  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth and Women MSMEs and Entrepreneurship Support Project (YWESP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is primarily to support financial inclusion and economic empowerment for the following categories:
&#xF0FC; Project owners who hold higher education degrees
&#xF0FC; Promoters of projects from graduates of vocational training institutes and centers.
&#xF0FC; Small farmers, craftsmen and traders
&#xF0FC; Skilled people and holders of competencies.
The specific objectives of the program are as follows. 

* Continuing to support projects that have been financed using Islamic financing formulas.
* Supporting investment in innovating micro-enterprises.
* Supporting investment in high-quality traditional industries.
* Financing start-up companies working in the field of innovation and ITC
* Financing FIN TEC high-tech enterprises
* Supporting investments that are integrated within production systems.</narrative>
  </description>
